Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue 1: Ansible collection not found

# Solution: Install the required collection
ansible-galaxy collection install freeipa.ansible_freeipa --force
Issue 2: IdM server installation fails

# Check DNS resolution
nslookup idm-server.example.com

# Verify firewall settings
firewall-cmd --list-all

# Check system resources
free -h
df -h
Issue 3: Client enrollment fails

# Verify network connectivity to IdM server
ping idm-server.example.com
telnet idm-server.example.com 443

# Check DNS configuration
cat /etc/resolv.conf
Issue 4: Authentication failures

# Test Kerberos authentication
kinit admin
klist

# Check SSSD status
systemctl status sssd
tail -f /var/log/sssd/sssd.log
Issue 5: Playbook execution errors

# Run with verbose output
ansible-playbook -vvv playbook.yml

# Check syntax
